source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A run of four is literal and the pair after it is the token's last run, so Jira breaks there and jiro reads four backslashes and a hard break.
-- input.jira --
a\\\\b\\c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\\\b<br class="atl-forced-newline" />c</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\\\\\b\
c
-- warnings.json --
[]
